title: SaskPower
subtitle: Saskatchewan Power Corporation

= SaskPower

SaskPower is the Crown Corporation dealing with power generation and distribution. Formed as the Saskatchewan Power Comission, it has made significant inroads into the private market, purchasing independently-owned electrical utilities. 

- @saskpower_monopoly: Grant SaskPower a Monopoly on Power
- @power_buyout: Buy Out Electrical Utilities Companies
- @power_sellout: Sell Parts of SaskPower to Private Companies
- @electrical_coop_sellout: Use SaskPower assets to establish Electrical Sector Worker's Cooperatives
- @rural_electrification: Expand Access to Electricity
- @return_crown: Return 


@saskpower_monopoly
subtitle: -5 budget, 100% Market Share
view-if: 1 = 1
choose-if: budget >= 20
go-to: exit_gov

@power_buyout
subtitle: -1 budget, +10% Market Share
choose-if: budget >= 1 
go-to: exit_gov

@power_sellout
subtitle: +1 budget, -10% Market Share
on-arrival: budget += 1
go-to: exit_gov

@electrical_coop_sellout
subtitle: -10% Market Share
go-to: exit_gov


@rural_electrification
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1
go-to: exit_gov